{"@context":{"lean":"lean:","block":"block:","imports":{"@type":"@id"}},"@graph":[{"@id":"lean:module:KnotsParticlesConfinement.CrossingEnergy","@type":"LeanModule","name":"KnotsParticlesConfinement.CrossingEnergy","imports":["lean:module:Init","lean:module:Mathlib.Data.Real.Basic","lean:module:Mathlib.Data.List.Count","lean:module:Mathlib.Tactic"],"declarations":15,"chunks":1},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Braiding.CrossingEnergy.swapped_agrees_iff_positive_braid","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Braiding.CrossingEnergy.swapped_agrees_iff_positive_braid","kind":"theorem","line":143,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/knots-particles-confinement/crossing-energy.lean#L143-L161","doc":"Corollary: the swapped assignment agrees with the Skein energy exactly\non positive braids (`n₋ = 0`), which is why the error survived — every\ncanonical atomic braid the corpus evaluates is positive. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Braiding.CrossingEnergy.swapped_decomposition_off_by","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Braiding.CrossingEnergy.swapped_decomposition_off_by","kind":"theorem","line":129,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/knots-particles-confinement/crossing-energy.lean#L129-L141","doc":"**The swapped assignment is not merely unproved — it is false.**\n\nStated as a theorem so the defect cannot recur silently: assigning the\ncrossing count to the symmetric channel and the writhe to the\nantisymmetric one reconstructs the Skein energy only when there are no\nnegative crossings. The discrepancy is exactly `2·n₋·q⁻¹`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Braiding.CrossingEnergy.decomposition","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Braiding.CrossingEnergy.decomposition","kind":"theorem","line":120,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/knots-particles-confinement/crossing-energy.lean#L120-L127","doc":"The crossing energy decomposes as baseline + Coulomb contribution:\n\nE_cross = ½(n₊ − n₋)(q + q⁻¹) + ½(n₊ + n₋)(q − q⁻¹) ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Braiding.CrossingEnergy.coulombContribution","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Braiding.CrossingEnergy.coulombContribution","kind":"def","line":112,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/knots-particles-confinement/crossing-energy.lean#L112-L118","doc":"Coulomb contribution: ½(n₊ + n₋)(q − q⁻¹).\n\nThe multiplicity is the **crossing count** `n₊ + n₋`: `sinh` is blind\nto the crossing sign, contributing `+sinh λ` for a negative crossing\nexactly as for a positive one. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Braiding.CrossingEnergy.baseline","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Braiding.CrossingEnergy.baseline","kind":"def","line":104,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/knots-particles-confinement/crossing-energy.lean#L104-L110","doc":"Baseline (strong) contribution: ½(n₊ − n₋)(q + q⁻¹).\n\nThe multiplicity is the **writhe** `n₊ − n₋`, not the crossing count:\n`cosh` carries the crossing sign, so reversing a crossing negates its\nsymmetric part. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Braiding.CrossingEnergy.value","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Braiding.CrossingEnergy.value","kind":"def","line":100,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/knots-particles-confinement/crossing-energy.lean#L100-L102","doc":"The crossing energy value: n₊ · q − n₋ · q⁻¹ (Skein sign). ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Braiding.CrossingEnergy.q","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Braiding.CrossingEnergy.q","kind":"def","line":95,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/knots-particles-confinement/crossing-energy.lean#L95-L95","doc":"Substrate parameter q. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Braiding.CrossingEnergy.braidWord","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Braiding.CrossingEnergy.braidWord","kind":"def","line":93,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/knots-particles-confinement/crossing-energy.lean#L93-L93","doc":"The braid word representing the linking pattern. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Braiding.CrossingEnergy.mk","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Braiding.CrossingEnergy.mk","kind":"ctor","line":91,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/knots-particles-confinement/crossing-energy.lean#L91-L91","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Braiding.CrossingEnergy","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Braiding.CrossingEnergy","kind":"structure","line":60,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/knots-particles-confinement/crossing-energy.lean#L60-L95","doc":"**Crossing energy** of a knot composite with braid word β and\nsubstrate parameter q.\n\nEach positive crossing contributes `q`, each negative crossing\n`−q⁻¹`, following the Skein sign convention of `def:crossing-energy`:\n\n  E_cross(H) = n₊ · q − n₋ · q⁻¹\n\n**CORRECTED 2026-08-29 (bean `qou-toul`).** This previously read\n`n₊ · q + n₋ · q⁻¹`, with a docstring stating that the `−q⁻¹` Skein\nsign \"governs the L₊/L₋ skein triple, not the energy magnitude\" and\nthat \"with `−q⁻¹` the baseline + Coulomb decomposition would not\nhold, so the energy is the additive `n₊·q + n₋·q⁻¹`\".\n\nThat is the defect, stated in its own docstring: the *definition was\nadjusted so that the theorem below would be provable*. The\ndecomposition then held by `ring` — of an object the `.md` sibling\ndoes not define. `def:crossing-energy` says `−q⁻¹` and cites the\nSkein relation; `QOU.Braiding.crossingEnergy` in the Lake tree also\nsays `−q⁻¹`. This file was the outlier.\n\nThe decomposition does hold for the Skein sign. What changes is\n*which multiplicity goes with which channel* — see `decomposition`,\nand `prop:crossing-energy-decomposition`, which has carried the\ncorrect form all along:\n\n  symmetric (strong)   ← (n₊ − n₋)   the writhe; cosh carries the sign\n  antisymmetric (Coul) ← (n₊ + n₋)   the count;  sinh is sign-blind\n\nThe two were swapped here and in `def:coulomb-charge`. ","formalizes":[{"@id":"block:def:crossing-energy","label":"def:crossing-energy","md":"quantum-observable-universe/knots-particles-confinement/crossing-energy.md"}],"signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Braiding.BraidWord.pos_plus_neg_eq_total","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Braiding.BraidWord.pos_plus_neg_eq_total","kind":"theorem","line":50,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/knots-particles-confinement/crossing-energy.lean#L50-L58","doc":"Positive + negative = total crossings. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Braiding.BraidWord.numCrossings","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Braiding.BraidWord.numCrossings","kind":"def","line":46,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/knots-particles-confinement/crossing-energy.lean#L46-L48","doc":"Total number of crossings in a braid word. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Braiding.BraidWord.numNegative","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Braiding.BraidWord.numNegative","kind":"def","line":42,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/knots-particles-confinement/crossing-energy.lean#L42-L44","doc":"Count of negative crossings in a braid word. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Braiding.BraidWord.numPositive","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Braiding.BraidWord.numPositive","kind":"def","line":38,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/knots-particles-confinement/crossing-energy.lean#L38-L40","doc":"Count of positive crossings in a braid word. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Braiding.BraidWord","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Braiding.BraidWord","kind":"def","line":34,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/knots-particles-confinement/crossing-energy.lean#L34-L36","doc":"A braid word: a finite list of signed crossings.\n`true` = positive crossing (L₊), `false` = negative crossing (L₋). ","signatureChunk":0}]}